      "playwright": "Canvas output is hard to assert pixel by pixel and the trails are deliberately soft, so the page exposes track geometry and physics bookkeeping through window.__chamber: turning caused by the field (kept separate from random scattering), straightness, width, charge and lifetime. The spec detaches requestAnimationFrame with manual(true), rewinds with restart(), and advances simulated seconds directly, which is more precise than page.clock for a fixed-timestep simulation. UI wiring is still exercised through the real controls: filling the field slider, unchecking toggles, and clicking Inject, Clear and Pause. The odometer counters are read through their data-count and aria-label attributes rather than their split digit boxes. No screenshots are compared.",
